  Part 3 — LLMPlanningAgent by mode — three distinct system     
  prompts; unified _parse_and_validate() dispatcher on          
  output_type; repair retry preserved for all modes
                                                                
  Part 4 — HeuristicPlanningAgent by mode — quick: existing     
  behavior; guided: _prompt_is_ambiguous() →     
  _make_heuristic_clarification() with floor/bedroom/layout     
  questions; options: _make_heuristic_options() returns 3   
  residential concept options (compact two-story, courtyard,
  linear); non-residential options falls back to quick with note

  Part 5 — CLI (ai_loop.py) — --planning-mode                   
  quick|guided|options (default quick), passed to agent.plan()
                                                                
  Part 6 — Artifact export — planning block now includes        
  planning_mode/output_type; clarification_request and
  concept_options exported as top-level artifact keys; FD loop  
  gated: if output_type != design_brief, exits after planning
  export                                         

