  FDClarificationRequest, FDConceptOption, FDConceptOptions;
  FDPlanning updated; FDArtifact extended;                      
  ClarificationRequestPanel.tsx (amber border, questions with
  importance badges, defaults highlighted);      
  ConceptOptionsPanel.tsx (violet border, recommended option
  highlighted, tradeoffs, level strategy previews);
  FDViewerClient.tsx renders both above DesignBriefPanel

